# Student Learning Experience: Enrollment & Course Player

This plan focuses on implementing the student's journey from course discovery to active learning.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Enrollment Logic**: Users will be allowed to "Quick Enroll" in free courses. Paid courses will require a completed Order.
> - **Access Security**: All lesson endpoints will be protected by a new [CheckEnrollment](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/app/Http/Middleware/CheckEnrollment.php#9-52) middleware.

## Proposed Changes

### [Backend] [Enrollments Module]

#### [NEW] [Enrollment Migration](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Enrollments/database/migrations/2026_03_23_000000_create_enrollments_table.php)
- Create `enrollments` table: `user_id`, `course_id`, [status](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Lessons/tests/Feature/LessonTest.php#67-83) (active, completed), `enrolled_at`.

#### [NEW] [Enrollment Model](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Enrollments/app/Models/Enrollment.php)
- Standard Eloquent model with relationships to [User](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/components/shared/UserNav.tsx#8-47) and [Course](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Courses/app/Models/Course.php#11-41).

#### [NEW] [CheckEnrollment Middleware](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/app/Http/Middleware/CheckEnrollment.php)
- Verify if the authenticated user has an active enrollment for the requested course/lesson.

